# Architectural Documentation - Monorepo DDD Pattern

## 📖 Overview

This document describes the architectural patterns and folder structure for a TypeScript monorepo implementing Domain-Driven Design (DDD) with hexagonal architecture. These patterns are designed to be reusable across different projects and provide clear separation of concerns, testability, and maintainability.

## 🏗️ Project Structure

### Core DDD Architecture (Non-Monorepo)

```
project-root/
├── src/
│   ├── domain/            # Domain logic, entities, contracts, and business rules
│   │   ├── {entity}/
│   │   │   ├── {Entity}.ts
│   │   │   ├── contracts/
│   │   │   ├── errors/
│   │   │   └── events/
│   │   └── shared/        # Shared domain utilities
│   ├── application/       # Use cases, application services, and orchestration
│   │   ├── {entity}/
│   │   │   ├── Create{Entity}.ts
│   │   │   ├── Find{Entity}ById.ts
│   │   │   └── events/
│   │   └── shared/        # Shared application services
│   └── infrastructure/    # External concerns, repositories, APIs, databases
│       ├── api/           # HTTP handlers and controllers
│       ├── repositories/  # Data persistence implementations
│       ├── services/      # External service integrations
│       ├── di/            # Dependency injection container
│       └── events/        # Event processing infrastructure
└── tests/                 # Test structure mirrors src/
    ├── domain/
    │   └── {entity}/
    │       ├── {Entity}.test.ts
    │       ├── {Entity}Mother.ts
    │       └── {Entity}RepositoryMock.ts
    ├── application/
    │   └── {entity}/
    │       ├── Create{Entity}.test.ts
    │       └── Find{Entity}ById.test.ts
    └── infrastructure/
        ├── repositories/
        ├── api/
        └── integration/
```

### Monorepo Variation

For larger projects, you might organize this within packages:

```
project-root/
├── packages/
│   ├── frontend/          # Frontend application
│   │   ├── src/
│   │   │   ├── components/
│   │   │   ├── pages/
│   │   │   └── services/
│   │   └── tests/
│   │       ├── components/
│   │       └── integration/
│   ├── backend/           # Backend application (application + infrastructure)
│   │   ├── src/
│   │   │   ├── application/
│   │   │   │   ├── {entity}/
│   │   │   │   │   ├── Create{Entity}.ts
│   │   │   │   │   └── Find{Entity}ById.ts
│   │   │   │   └── shared/
│   │   │   └── infrastructure/
│   │   │       ├── api/
│   │   │       ├── repositories/
│   │   │       ├── services/
│   │   │       └── di/
│   │   └── tests/         # Tests mirror src/ structure
│   │       ├── application/
│   │       │   └── {entity}/
│   │       └── infrastructure/
│   │           ├── repositories/
│   │           └── api/
│   ├── shared/            # Domain logic only
│   │   ├── src/
│   │   │   └── domain/
│   │   │       ├── {entity}/
│   │   │       │   ├── {Entity}.ts
│   │   │       │   ├── contracts/
│   │   │       │   ├── errors/
│   │   │       │   └── events/
│   │   │       └── shared/
│   │   └── tests/         # Tests mirror src/ structure
│   │       └── domain/
│   │           └── {entity}/
│   │               ├── {Entity}.test.ts
│   │               ├── {Entity}Mother.ts
│   │               └── {Entity}RepositoryMock.ts
│   └── scripts/           # Utility scripts
├── docs/                  # Project documentation
└── tests/                 # E2E and integration tests across packages
```

